# Copy to deploy/.env on the host (git ignores it) and fill in what exists; docker compose reads it from this folder.

# The origin a local `docker compose up --build` bakes into the image, with its sub-path if any. The published image is built with the SITE_ORIGIN repository variable instead.
SITE_ORIGIN=http://localhost:8080

# Enabled by: the GitHub webhook registration. Generate with `openssl rand -hex 32` and give the same value to the webhook in the repository settings.
# DEPLOY_WEBHOOK_SECRET=
